@startuml 20_state_escalation
!include _style.iuml
title State Machine Diagram (3/5) — Escalation (escalations.status)

[*] --> OPEN : trigger: low confidence, E02 policy,\ninsufficient inventory, budget,\nOUTCOME_UNKNOWN / record reason_code
OPEN --> CLAIMED : operator claims\n[member of business ∧ assignment allowed]\n/ assigned_user_id = operator
CLAIMED --> OPEN : operator releases
CLAIMED --> RESOLVED : decision approve / reject / clarify\n[expected_resume_revision matches]\n/ store resolution, resume or close run
CLAIMED --> CLAIMED : stale revision\n/ conflict, reload facts
RESOLVED --> [*]

state CLAIMED {
  [*] --> Reviewing
  Reviewing --> Reconciling : pending OUTCOME_UNKNOWN
  Reconciling --> Reviewing : operation log checked
  Reviewing --> Deciding
}
@enduml
